Subject: [PATCH 278/294] pvr, pdsc: add xfb_end program interface and wiring

Signed-off-by: Ashish Chauhan <ashish.chauhan@imgtec.com>
Acked-by: Frank Binns <frank.binns@imgtec.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/44385>
(cherry picked from commit 6cae0f81cd77cf6c25d7803cfc392aa1004a7bd1)
---
 src/imagination/common/pvr_iface.h           |  45 +++++
 src/imagination/pdsc/pdsc_precomp.c          |   2 +
 src/imagination/pdsc/programs/pdsc_xfb_end.h | 186 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 233 insertions(+)
